# Dinkster Architecture & Coding Guidelines

## Project Overview
- **Monorepo**: Turborepo / npm workspaces with `apps/mobile`, `apps/web`, `packages/shared`, `packages/database`.
- **Target Surfaces**: iOS & Apple Watch (mobile), Web & Tablet Kiosk (organizer/desk).

## Key Directives
1. Use `@dinkster/shared` for all scoring rules, types, and theme constants.
2. In `apps/mobile`: Use `useGameStore` connected to `@dinkster/shared`.
3. In `apps/web`: Use Next.js 14 App Router and `@dinkster/database` Prisma client.
4. Player IDs are strictly `DK-XXXXX`.
5. Game join codes are strictly `D-XXXX`.
6. Host scoring override must remain silent to non-host players.
7. Support the Dink Battle pilot variation (half-court after 5th shot).
